# ─── Error Tracking (Sentry) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Empty = no-op (default) — leaving this blank means no network calls are
# ever made and no error data ever leaves this machine. Replace with your
# real project DSN before going live (format below is a dummy example, not
# a working value — using it as-is would silently start sending events to
# a nonexistent project). Get the real one from:
# https://sentry.io -> Settings -> Projects -> <project> -> Client Keys (DSN)
# Example format: https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
